WEBVTT

00:00:00.543 --> 00:00:01.230
Hi there!

00:00:01.290 --> 00:00:03.369
Paper receipts get stuffed in a wallet,

00:00:03.319 --> 00:00:06.750
and by the end of the month the ink has faded, and some are lost.

00:00:07.028 --> 00:00:10.350
With Tositeo, you snap the receipt right after you pay.

00:00:10.619 --> 00:00:14.750
It reads the date, the merchant, the total and the VAT by itself.

00:00:15.099 --> 00:00:18.590
The receipt is stored safely, and reaches your accountant in the right order.

00:00:19.019 --> 00:00:21.790
In this lesson, we'll work with a nail salon in Germany.

00:00:22.418 --> 00:00:26.514
After you log in, click the blue camera button at the top, Add receipt.

00:00:26.622 --> 00:00:27.714
It's on every page.

00:00:27.925 --> 00:00:32.754
Or, on the Overview page, scroll down to Add, and click the Receipt box.

00:00:33.365 --> 00:00:36.452
Click the box Take a photo or choose a file.

00:00:36.707 --> 00:00:39.092
On a phone, the camera opens right away:

00:00:39.341 --> 00:00:42.372
lay the receipt on a flat surface, and take a sharp photo.

00:00:42.865 --> 00:00:47.972
On a computer, choose an image or a PDF file, or drag the file into this box.

00:00:48.241 --> 00:00:52.612
For a long or two-sided receipt, click Add pages to take another photo.

00:00:53.256 --> 00:00:57.991
In just a few seconds, Tositeo reads the text in the photo and fills in the fields:

00:00:58.169 --> 00:01:02.791
the Purchase date, the Total incl. VAT, the VAT rate, and the VAT amount.

00:01:03.174 --> 00:01:09.031
Here it's 176.45 €, with 19 % VAT, just like on the receipt.

00:01:09.451 --> 00:01:13.831
It reads receipts from many countries, based on the country your company chose.

00:01:14.359 --> 00:01:15.129
But remember:

00:01:15.176 --> 00:01:17.369
text recognition can make mistakes too.

00:01:17.544 --> 00:01:21.049
Like here, the Merchant field picked up a product line by mistake.

00:01:21.301 --> 00:01:23.209
We just type the shop's name correctly.

00:01:23.462 --> 00:01:26.973
Every time, take a quick look and compare with the paper receipt,

00:01:26.923 --> 00:01:28.729
especially the total and the VAT.

00:01:29.328 --> 00:01:32.585
Next, under Paid with, choose how you paid:

00:01:32.772 --> 00:01:35.865
Company card, Company account, or Own money.

00:01:36.209 --> 00:01:40.505
If it's your own money, Tositeo notes it, so you're reimbursed after approval.

00:01:40.790 --> 00:01:43.385
Choose the expense type, here Nail supplies.

00:01:43.727 --> 00:01:47.625
Every expense type has its account number, so your accountant doesn't have to guess.

00:01:48.010 --> 00:01:50.505
Then write briefly what you bought and why.

00:01:50.929 --> 00:01:53.465
For entertainment expenses, write who attended.

00:01:53.973 --> 00:01:56.183
When you're done, click Send for approval.

00:01:56.287 --> 00:01:56.983
In a hurry?

00:01:56.946 --> 00:01:59.303
Click Save as draft, and finish it later.

00:01:59.652 --> 00:02:01.063
Got a whole stack of receipts?

00:02:01.092 --> 00:02:04.823
Tick Add another after saving, and a new page opens right away.

00:02:05.397 --> 00:02:08.112
The receipt is saved, and it's Waiting for approval.

00:02:08.546 --> 00:02:10.592
The original photo is kept with the receipt.

00:02:10.772 --> 00:02:13.367
Below, there's Messages with the accountant,

00:02:13.317 --> 00:02:16.432
to ask and answer right on this receipt, and History,

00:02:16.546 --> 00:02:18.112
which records every change.

00:02:18.684 --> 00:02:20.748
Still a stack of receipts at the end of the month?

00:02:21.104 --> 00:02:24.596
On the Add receipt page, click Upload several as drafts,

00:02:24.546 --> 00:02:26.747
and choose up to ten files at once.

00:02:26.940 --> 00:02:28.508
Each file becomes a draft.

00:02:28.763 --> 00:02:32.021
Then open each draft, look at the photo to fill in the date,

00:02:31.971 --> 00:02:35.068
the merchant and the amount, and click Send for approval.

00:02:35.656 --> 00:02:37.386
All receipts are under Receipts.

00:02:37.491 --> 00:02:39.946
The tabs at the top sort them by status:

00:02:40.010 --> 00:02:44.666
Drafts, Waiting for approval, Approved, Returned, and Booked.

00:02:45.098 --> 00:02:47.946
The search box even finds text in the receipt photos.

00:02:48.289 --> 00:02:52.106
You can also filter by month, by expense type, and by person.

00:02:52.715 --> 00:02:54.184
You only need one habit:

00:02:54.291 --> 00:02:56.504
as soon as you pay, snap the receipt.

00:02:56.926 --> 00:02:58.104
It takes less than a minute.

00:02:58.593 --> 00:03:01.944
At the end of the month, no more digging through your wallet for receipts.

00:03:02.293 --> 00:03:04.024
Now take the quiz below the video.
